{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">病理基础模型：从 patch encoder 到 whole-slide 多模态推理</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Pathology Foundations</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_105_virchow-title\">Virchow</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">Virchow 是 632M ViT-H/14 的病理 tile foundation encoder，以约 150 万临床 WSI 的 DINOv2 自监督规模取胜。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">632M-parameter ViT-H/14 computational pathology tile foundation model pretrained with DINOv2 on 2 billion tiles from 1.5 million clinical H&amp;E whole-slide images.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">H&amp;E 全切片切出的组织 tile 及其全局/局部增强视图</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">224×224 H&amp;E histopathology tissue tile (with global and local crops during pretraining)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">tile-level 632M ViT embedding；下游可经 WSI aggregator 形成病例预测</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2560-D tile representation ([CLS] concatenated with mean patch token) feeding downstream WSI aggregators</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1(e–f) · PDF p.Official full-size Figure 1 asset</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-024-03141-0\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_105_virchow')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_105_virchow')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Virchow original paper architecture figure, Figure 1(e–f)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/f68e890ce0b7c62c55c4.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1(e–f) · PDF p.Official full-size Figure 1 asset</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_105_virchow', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_105_virchow\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_105_virchow')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_105_virchow', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_105_virchow\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">H&amp;E whole-slide images</span><span class=\"lang-en\">H&amp;E whole-slide images</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">约 150 万 WSI 的临床病理训练库</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 224×224 h&amp;e histopathology tissue tile (with global and local crops during pretraining) and prepares initial tensor representations (H&amp;E whole-slide images).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"约 150 万 WSI 的临床病理训练库\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 224×224 h&amp;e histopathology tissue tile (with global and local crops during pretraining) and prepares initial tensor representations (H&amp;E whole-slide images).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"H&amp;E whole-slide images\" data-node-name-en=\"H&amp;E whole-slide images\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_105_virchow', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>H&amp;E whole-slide images</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">约 150 万 WSI 的临床病理训练库</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 224×224 h&amp;e histopathology tissue tile (with global and local crops during pretraining) and prepares initial tensor representations (H&amp;E whole-slide images).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"WSI 切块后形成全局和局部组织视图\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes tile to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"组织 tile 与多裁剪\" data-node-name-en=\"tile\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_105_virchow', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">组织 tile 与多裁剪</span><span class=\"lang-en\">tile</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">WSI 切块后形成全局和局部组织视图</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes tile to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"632M 参数 tile encoder 学习 patch 与全局表征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs ViT-H/14 student within the core clinical scale dinov2 vith tile encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"ViT-H/14 student\" data-node-name-en=\"ViT-H/14 student\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_105_virchow', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>ViT-H/14 student</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">632M 参数 tile encoder 学习 patch 与全局表征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs ViT-H/14 student within the core clinical scale dinov2 vith tile encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按 DINOv2 更新，提供跨视图自蒸馏目标\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs EMA teacher within the core clinical scale dinov2 vith tile encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"EMA teacher\" data-node-name-en=\"EMA teacher\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_105_virchow', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>EMA teacher</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按 DINOv2 更新，提供跨视图自蒸馏目标</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs EMA teacher within the core clinical scale dinov2 vith tile encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"结合全局/局部自蒸馏与 patch-level 学习\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs DINOv2 multi-view objective within the core clinical scale dinov2 vith tile encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"DINOv2 多视图目标\" data-node-name-en=\"DINOv2 multi-view objective\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_105_virchow', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">DINOv2 多视图目标</span><span class=\"lang-en\">DINOv2 multi-view objective</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">结合全局/局部自蒸馏与 patch-level 学习</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs DINOv2 multi-view objective within the core clinical scale dinov2 vith tile encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可冻结抽取局部组织形态表示\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Virchow tile embedding within the core clinical scale dinov2 vith tile encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Virchow tile embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"Virchow tile embedding\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_105_virchow', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Virchow tile embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可冻结抽取局部组织形态表示</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Virchow tile embedding within the core clinical scale dinov2 vith tile encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"MIL/attention 等任务模型汇聚数千 tile；不是 Virchow 预训练主体\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies WSI aggregator to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"下游 WSI aggregator\" data-node-name-en=\"WSI aggregator\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_105_virchow', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">下游 WSI aggregator</span><span class=\"lang-en\">WSI aggregator</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">MIL/attention 等任务模型汇聚数千 tile；不是 Virchow 预训练主体</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies WSI aggregator to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"癌症检测、稀有癌、细胞或 biomarker 预测\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces 2560-d tile representation ([cls] concatenated with mean patch token) feeding downstream wsi aggregators via head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"临床任务 head\" data-node-name-en=\"head\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_105_virchow', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">临床任务 head</span><span class=\"lang-en\">head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">癌症检测、稀有癌、细胞或 biomarker 预测</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces 2560-d tile representation ([cls] concatenated with mean patch token) feeding downstream wsi aggregators via head.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Virchow Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 病理 tile 的 DINOv2 全局蒸馏与 iBOT 掩码学习</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · 632M ViT-H/14 DINOv2 Global Distillation + iBOT Masked Patch + KoLeo Regularization</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Virchow：核心公式 · 病理 tile 的 DINOv2 全局蒸馏与 iBOT 掩码学习\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"105\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"22.39573pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.011212 217.665048 22.39573\" width=\"217.665048pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><pa