\"></use><use x=\"134.719375\" xlink:href=\"#m105_g13-150\" y=\"-55.191059\"></use><use x=\"137.024826\" xlink:href=\"#m105_g13-56\" y=\"-55.191059\"></use><use x=\"146.093826\" xlink:href=\"#m105_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">病理监督标签稀缺且稀有癌种难覆盖，ImageNet 特征域差距大</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Smaller pathology models struggled on rare cancer variants and cross-laboratory staining variations.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在百万级全切片 patch 上自监督预训练大规模 ViT 病理编码器</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Scale both model capacity (ViT-H/14, 632M) and clinical data volume (1.5M WSIs from MSKCC) under DINOv2 self-supervised learning.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">利用海量临床 WSI 和 DINOv2 式预训练提升低样本与稀有任务迁移</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Institutional gigapixel scale (1.5M slides) + 632M ViT-H architecture demonstrating strong pan-cancer and rare-cancer generalization.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">支持 pan-cancer detection、稀有癌、细胞识别和 biomarker prediction</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Supports pan-cancer detection, rare tumor identification, biomarker prediction, and cell-level pathology tasks.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">病理 FM 关键里程碑；患者级去重、扫描域移位和独立比较仍重要</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Landmark high-capacity pathology tile encoder; independent benchmarks show ensemble diversity with UNI/CONCH remains valuable.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">在大规模临床 H&amp;E tile 上训练 ViT-H，而非从 ImageNet 特征起步。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">DINOv2 的多视图 student—teacher 自蒸馏无需人工病理标签。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">预训练产物首先是 tile encoder；WSI 级结论仍需额外聚合器。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Scale both model capacity (ViT-H/14, 632M) and clinical data volume (1.5M WSIs from MSKCC) under DINOv2 self-supervised learning.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Institutional gigapixel scale (1.5M slides) + 632M ViT-H architecture demonstrating strong pan-cancer and rare-cancer generalization.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: 632M ViT-H/14 DINOv2 Global Distillation + iBOT Masked Patch + KoLeo Regularization.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">为 pan-cancer、稀有癌、细胞识别和 biomarker 任务提供低样本 tile 特征。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">tile 级强表示不自动解决 WSI 空间稀疏性，聚合器、患者去重和扫描域移位必须单独评估。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Supports pan-cancer detection, rare tumor identification, biomarker prediction, and cell-level pathology tasks.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Landmark high-capacity pathology tile encoder; independent benchmarks show ensemble diversity with UNI/CONCH remains valuable.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41591-024-03141-0\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>A Foundation Model for Clinical-Grade Computational Pathology and Rare Cancers Detection</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/paige-ai/Virchow\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}